Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.96,0:22:04.46,ed-eng,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{}My voice swoops up and down with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.40,0:00:07.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.84,0:00:09.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.12,0:00:13.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.44,0:00:14.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.87,0:00:14.91,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,Coming...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.90,0:00:24.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's been a while, Dai-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.19,0:00:26.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Haruko...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.52,0:00:28.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What're you doing here all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.28,0:00:28.54,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.99,0:00:29.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Reina-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.92,0:00:31.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.25,0:00:33.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's going on, Reina-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.52,0:00:35.09,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you going away somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.48,0:00:35.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Haruko...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.09,0:00:37.10,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,Nope! We came to visit you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.55,0:00:38.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.10,0:00:38.85,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.85,0:00:40.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you like sweet buns, Reina-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.99,0:00:42.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's a sweet bun?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.16,0:00:43.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a round and sweet snack.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.90,0:00:44.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then I like it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.15,0:00:48.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, go get Reina-chan some barley tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.08,0:00:50.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay! Come on, Reina-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.03,0:00:52.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We were just having snacks...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.21,0:00:53.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I want some, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.70,0:02:35.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's really good!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.15,0:02:36.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Told you so!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.13,0:02:38.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is the first time I've ever tried one!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.68,0:02:44.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.97,0:02:46.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's so strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.34,0:02:48.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've never been here before, but it feels so much like Granddad's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.89,0:02:50.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you going to tell me what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.56,0:02:52.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You brought her school bag and stuff here on a Sunday...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.45,0:02:54.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.01,0:02:58.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The truth is that we've run away from home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.32,0:02:59.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,W-Wha...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.52,0:03:01.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They'll all be worried sick about you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.45,0:03:02.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why'd you do something like that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.26,0:03:08.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I-Is it that...?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.01,0:03:09.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is it what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.30,0:03:11.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I mean... Did something happen with your husb{\fscx300}-
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.99,0:03:13.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's part of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.49,0:03:15.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Part of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.06,0:03:16.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Part of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.00,0:03:18.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Did something happen with his pare{\fscx300}-
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.59,0:03:20.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's part of it, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.50,0:03:26.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I guess living with your husband's parents must be difficult, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.05,0:03:31.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Perhaps it's just impossible for people to live together without tearing each other apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.54,0:03:33.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.80,0:03:37.91,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah! That's the same maths textbook we use!{Rin}{Ψ's mark}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.85,0:03:37.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't have any siblings, so we don't really have anywhere else to go...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.91,0:03:39.60,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,Really?{Reina}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.91,0:03:39.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is it okay if we stay here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.60,0:03:44.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Y-You're going to have to tell me a bit more about the situation...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.60,0:03:41.95,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,Let me see your other textbooks!{Rin}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.00,0:03:45.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Have you told your parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.95,0:03:44.00,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,Sure! Um...{Reina}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.02,0:03:46.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.00,0:03:46.37,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah! Your Japanese textbook is different.{Rin}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.02,0:03:48.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I left a note behind for my husband and his parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.19,0:03:48.65,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,I want to see!{Reina}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.31,0:03:50.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't tell them where I was going, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.65,0:03:50.18,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,Sure!{Rin}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.20,0:03:53.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And I'll take Reina to school.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.18,0:03:55.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I haven't really thought about much beyond that,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.91,0:03:57.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,and I haven't told my parents yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.07,0:03:58.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Haven't really thought about much?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.63,0:04:00.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But you brought your daughter here with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.19,0:04:04.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I had no other choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.02,0:04:06.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I had to get out of that house!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.58,0:04:07.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I couldn't bear another second there!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.92,0:04:12.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Guess it can't be helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.92,0:04:15.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,For now, let's go pick up some things for dinner tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.83,0:04:17.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Dai-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.31,0:04:20.38,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,You're right! It really is different!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.66,0:04:20.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't offer you much, but you can use the room on the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.93,0:04:26.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks. It's a little heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.95,0:04:29.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What the heck do you have stuffed in here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.48,0:04:33.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Reina's slippers and textbooks are in there, too, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.39,0:04:35.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm surprised you made it this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.16,0:04:44.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Dai-chan, I know what sort of stuff you get by on, so tonight, I'll whip you up a real meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.34,0:04:45.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.20,0:04:48.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, can we go and look at the sweets?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.80,0:04:50.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. You can have one each.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.86,0:04:52.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.75,0:04:54.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What sort of meat should we get?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.23,0:04:58.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Does it matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.09,0:04:58.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That one isn't good!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.89,0:04:59.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Take this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.94,0:05:02.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe this one's not so good, either...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.65,0:05:08.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, Daikichi-san! Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.87,0:05:12.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Dai-chan, this ground beef and pork is really cheap!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.37,0:05:14.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.94,0:05:18.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah! No! You've got it all wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.61,0:05:21.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Her name's Haruko. She's my cousin on my mother's side.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.74,0:05:23.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why does she need to know which side I'm on?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.88,0:05:26.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see! Pleased to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.91,0:05:32.57,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,My son is one of Rin-chan's classmates, and Daikichi-san is always helping me out... {Kouki's mum}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.28,0:05:32.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Damn. What am I saying? She didn't even ask...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.57,0:05:35.59,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,I see! Then he'll be the same age as my daughter.{Haruko~}{Ψ's mark}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.57,0:05:35.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't even know why I'm making excuses, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.59,0:05:37.23,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, really?{Kouki's mum}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.59,0:05:37.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"You've got it all wrong!"? What the heck was I saying?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.58,0:05:39.75,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Reina.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.78,0:05:40.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She just started first grade.{Haruko}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.75,0:05:41.07,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Kouki.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.43,0:05:41.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.07,0:05:42.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.21,0:05:43.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yo, Kouki!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.50,0:05:45.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What sweets did you get?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.17,0:05:46.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Daikichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.24,0:05:47.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.49,0:05:49.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Deluxe Big Nyan Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.88,0:05:52.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm getting vegetable cakes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.11,0:05:55.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm getting candy with a toy of Meow Meow Tumbles!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.07,0:06:00.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are those really sweets?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.21,0:06:08.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's really pretty, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.23,0:06:14.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,W-Well, I guess she's one of the prettier mothers I've met...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.49,0:06:18.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wouldn't go about having a fling with her, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.51,0:06:20.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A-Are you some kind of moron?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.70,0:06:22.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's not like that at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.63,0:06:25.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, she has her hands full taking care of Kouki on her own.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.16,0:06:26.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She wouldn't even have time for...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.57,0:06:27.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,On her own?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.43,0:06:28.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.27,0:06:30.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You've seen too many weird dramas!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.21,0:06:33.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She looks about two or three years older than us. What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.41,0:06:35.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why should I care how old she is?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.84,0:06:39.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So she's divorced, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.68,0:06:42.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't really know...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.17,0:06:47.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It looks good!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.01,0:06:49.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've never had this before!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.10,0:06:51.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I tried something a little different.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.03,0:06:54.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Usually, my mother-in-law has the last say on everything, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.29,0:06:57.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mama, we should have this at home, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.82,0:07:02.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, then, let's eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.93,0:07:04.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.18,0:07:06.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's good!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.35,0:07:08.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, Rin-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.06,0:07:10.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Reina. Hold your chopsticks properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.44,0:07:11.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.12,0:07:15.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The floor's all creaky!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.63,0:07:16.24,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,Reina! Take this towel!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.24,0:07:17.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.47,0:07:18.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.71,0:07:20.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A bra!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.04,0:07:23.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Reina! Don't pull on it like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.38,0:07:33.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are they asleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.23,0:07:35.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, finally...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.55,0:07:37.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They were both pretty hyper.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.96,0:07:40.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I moved Rin-chan into your futon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.98,0:07:41.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.13,0:07:42.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.02,0:07:47.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's really good!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.05,0:07:48.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's been too long since I've had alcohol!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.72,0:07:50.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Want something to eat, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.08,0:07:52.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've been putting on weight recently, so I'll give it a pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.83,0:07:54.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's just like I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.54,0:07:56.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You mean I've really gained weight?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.03,0:07:57.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.54,0:07:59.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just that we're definitely in our thirties now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.06,0:08:03.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'd take just being thirty now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.35,0:08:05.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Once you get older, you just can't push yourself in the same way, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.99,0:08:07.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You have to start taking care of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.73,0:08:10.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Although, it's not like my husband looks at me anymore, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.77,0:08:13.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know who I'm trying to stay thin for.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.31,0:08:19.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Haruko...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.00,0:08:19.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.93,0:08:23.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,While you guys were in the bath, I called your house.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.91,0:08:28.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?! Why?! Don't do weird things like that, Dai-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.00,0:08:31.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's not weird. They'll be worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.38,0:08:33.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All I told them was that you were both okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.40,0:08:36.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,and that you'll be staying with me for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.31,0:08:37.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't even tell them my address.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.93,0:08:40.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I already left them a letter!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.51,0:08:41.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.50,0:08:42.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.54,0:08:45.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can do what you want, but I'm worried about Reina.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.43,0:08:49.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Reina's with me, and she's holding up fine. What's wrong with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.19,0:08:56.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Even so, if you don't tell them where you are and that she's okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.81,0:09:00.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,how the heck are they supposed to know she's safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.39,0:09:02.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't care about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.35,0:09:03.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You need to calm down a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.60,0:09:06.73,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you just want to cause your family trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.35,0:09:05.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.06,0:09:11.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.95,0:09:12.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.02,0:09:19.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's my nose!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.25,0:09:24.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Papa and Mama are always fighting...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.71,0:09:26.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Even though they're married?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.26,0:09:30.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yep. Even though they're married. I always pretend to just be asleep...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.77,0:09:34.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's hold hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.06,0:09:35.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.40,0:09:37.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It tickles!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.08,0:09:38.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's my cheek!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.06,0:09:46.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I... Every single day, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.02,0:09:49.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Since the day I got married, I've kept my feelings bottled up inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.52,0:09:53.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I have the right to cause them a bit of trouble, don't I?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.21,0:10:01.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry, Dai-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.09,0:10:02.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That was a horrible thing to say...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.76,0:10:03.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, it's fine...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.39,0:10:06.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.25,0:10:07.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.46,0:10:14.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Dai-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.20,0:10:33.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Goodnight, Dai-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.82,0:10:35.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Goodnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.94,0:10:49.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.96,0:10:51.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.42,0:10:52.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.98,0:10:55.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan, are you making breakfast?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.59,0:10:57.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, good morning Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.60,0:10:59.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're up early today, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.42,0:11:00.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I guess...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.19,0:11:02.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Dai-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.42,0:11:04.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You have Rin-chan make you breakfast?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.34,0:11:06.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,D-Don't be stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.14,0:11:08.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We always make meals together!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.56,0:11:10.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And when we're cooking with a flame, I{\fscx300}-
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.49,0:11:11.68,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,Play nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.37,0:11:18.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, you've got rice on your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.99,0:11:23.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Eat up quickly. We're taking the train to school today.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.93,0:11:24.32,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.02,0:11:27.43,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.46,0:11:27.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who could that be at a time like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.43,0:11:28.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's Kouki-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.61,0:11:29.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.63,0:11:31.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just come in, already!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.17,0:11:32.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're disturbing the neighbours!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.93,0:11:34.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan, is your school far away?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.79,0:11:35.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You have to leave this early?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.92,0:11:36.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nope!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.20,0:11:42.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun's mum is busy, so he comes here early.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.09,0:11:46.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,G-Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.10,0:11:48.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, did you get married?!{XD!}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.08,0:11:50.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course not! She's my cousin!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.71,0:11:53.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh. That figures.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.08,0:11:55.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.69,0:11:57.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, you want to get married?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.48,0:11:59.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,N-No, it's not like...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.78,0:12:02.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mama, you'd rather be single, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.87,0:12:05.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's "single"?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.61,0:12:07.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It means not being married.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.31,0:12:09.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah! I've heard of that! "Divorce", right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.58,0:12:11.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know what "divorce" is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.45,0:12:16.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hm... So your mum is married, but she wants to be single...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.54,0:12:19.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And Daikichi is single, but wants to be married?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.29,0:12:21.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Adults are so weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.63,0:12:23.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They really are.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.61,0:12:28.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, can I have a rice ball?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.58,0:12:30.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You had breakfast before you came here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.12,0:12:31.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.22,0:12:33.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Knock yourself out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.63,0:12:34.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That one was supposed to be mine, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.65,0:12:35.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.10,0:12:39.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You didn't have breakfast?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.07,0:12:41.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You have a good heart, huh, Dai-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.82,0:12:43.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Because I gave a kid a rice ball?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.92,0:12:45.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's not what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.17,0:12:46.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.53,0:12:49.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're just as busy as her, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.51,0:12:52.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I guess you really have a thing for that pretty mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.87,0:12:55.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I-Id{\fscx300}-{\r} Blockhead!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.17,0:12:56.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That again?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.36,0:13:01.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I just thought that I could help out a little,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.61,0:13:04.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,and Rin gets along well with the two of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.80,0:13:06.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.53,0:13:11.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know the details, but I'm sure Kouki and his mum have been through a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.83,0:13:14.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It'd be rude of me to not respect that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.34,0:13:20.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Single mothers really have it hard, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.77,0:13:21.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.48,0:13:26.95,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,Reina! I told you to hurry! We're going to be late!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.63,0:13:25.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Haruko...? {line added. I think that's what I hear?}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.32,0:13:29.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.14,0:13:30.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.75,0:13:32.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You have to keep where we're staying a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.72,0:13:34.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?! Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.56,0:13:36.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just because. Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.63,0:13:37.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yep!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.62,0:13:38.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.72,0:13:40.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.05,0:13:42.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Reina-chan, did you come with your mum?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.32,0:13:43.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.84,0:13:48.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We secretly ran away from home, so we came by train today!{XD Oh Reina...}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.12,0:13:50.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.00,0:14:14.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.18,0:14:16.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.87,0:14:19.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I told you to hold on tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.65,0:14:21.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not getting you another one,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.32,0:14:26.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,but it might be waiting for us when we get home, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.10,0:14:29.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You might be right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.48,0:14:37.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.87,0:14:39.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, you're working late tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.69,0:14:41.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yep! My husband's watching the kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.87,0:14:43.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, is Yuu-kun well?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.65,0:14:45.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sure is!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.12,0:14:49.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's been so full of beans recently that I've barely been able to handle him. {beans?}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.73,0:14:52.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's nice that your husband helps out, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.23,0:14:53.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is the first time he has!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.74,0:14:56.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And it's only because his business trip was rescheduled, so he's off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.19,0:14:56.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.94,0:15:00.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You just can't leave raising a kid to your husband, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.71,0:15:06.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry up! Reina-chan's waiting! {Expression on Rin's face is so :3}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.95,0:15:07.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right, right...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.15,0:15:26.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're home, Reina-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.63,0:15:37.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They fell asleep right away tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.24,0:15:41.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Haruko, don't tell me that you're going to take things even further than this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.92,0:15:46.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, you mean a divorce or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.85,0:15:48.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.86,0:15:52.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No way. Not a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.21,0:15:56.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Look at me, getting all worked up for nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.04,0:15:59.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I've thought about it plenty of times.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.13,0:16:03.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Actually, I think about it pretty much every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.54,0:16:08.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,After all, when you start thinking about the man you're married to as an enemy, things are already...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.88,0:16:12.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Apart from Reina, they're all strangers and enemies to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.70,0:16:15.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I think of our family being just the two of us,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.28,0:16:19.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,but someone in my position simply can't afford to think like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.61,0:16:23.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I have Reina to think about, and then there's the question of how I'd make a living...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.56,0:16:27.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And with all the battles I'd have to fight to break away from my husband...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.85,0:16:33.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It seems like I'm better off just sticking with things the way they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.35,0:16:37.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I got married as soon as I joined a company.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.05,0:16:43.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,At that age, all I thought about was becoming a good wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.49,0:16:48.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's nothing else to it. No other way to protect Reina.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.36,0:16:52.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You know, I'm not even married,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.62,0:16:55.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,and just keeping a family going is pretty difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.33,0:16:57.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You do everything yourself, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.62,0:16:58.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's pretty amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.01,0:17:01.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nah, I haven't been able to do anything for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.67,0:17:05.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's not how it is all! Rin-chan looks like she's having lots of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.32,0:17:07.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,When she's cooking for you, for example...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.26,0:17:12.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And Kouki-kun and his mother are doing just fine on their own,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.50,0:17:15.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,so Reina and I will be okay with just the two of us, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.21,0:17:16.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You keep saying it's just the two of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.99,0:17:19.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you talk to your husband?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.28,0:17:24.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's always stuck doing overtime, so we never talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.56,0:17:27.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So I'll do my best with just Reina.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.66,0:17:31.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, I've put up with it for so many years already.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.19,0:17:33.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.33,0:17:37.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,As long as I stop myself from feeling too much, I can let pretty much anything go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.11,0:17:40.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's really unhealthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.93,0:17:41.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Quite the contrary!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.90,0:17:43.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If I didn't do it, I'd fall apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.94,0:17:48.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You've gotten really strong, Haruko.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.53,0:17:50.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hm, I wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.37,0:17:55.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,To raise a kid, you need to be able to call up these huge surges of strength,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.26,0:17:57.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,especially when she's still a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.25,0:18:02.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't really know what it's like with a baby, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.74,0:18:08.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And while I was doing that, I just sort of ended up like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.70,0:18:11.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't want to end up as some old lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.46,0:18:14.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't want to be strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.55,0:18:21.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wanted to just stay as a girl forever... {;___;}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.79,0:18:27.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry, Dai-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.03,0:18:28.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.10,0:18:30.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We'll go home tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.88,0:18:32.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.73,0:18:36.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What is marriage?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.51,0:18:39.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What does it mean to become a parent?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.41,0:18:47.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.53,0:18:49.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's your turn, Reina.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.98,0:18:51.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.73,0:18:52.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It really is!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.48,0:18:53.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"It really is" what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.46,0:18:54.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Papa's car!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.54,0:18:58.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Papa's coming after he finishes work.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.95,0:19:00.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He wouldn't be here this early.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.91,0:19:04.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's definitely Papa! I'm not wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.57,0:19:07.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Reina, it's not him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.00,0:19:10.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.87,0:19:12.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I was worried about you, Reina.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.56,0:19:14.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I was worried about you, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.28,0:19:16.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.49,0:19:21.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh. So if he {\i1}actually{\i0} wants to get off work at this time, he has no problem...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.18,0:19:22.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, don't be like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.98,0:19:24.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's pretty hard working at a company, too, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.37,0:19:26.47,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,Stupid Hideyuki-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.81,0:19:28.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.43,0:19:30.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Haruko's caused you so much trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.19,0:19:33.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, no, it really wasn't a...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.81,0:19:36.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm wearing the wrong clothes for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.79,0:19:40.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you so much, Dai-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.99,0:19:44.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Papa could at least carry our bags, couldn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.81,0:19:46.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's always so inconsiderate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.45,0:19:49.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah! "Inconsridat"!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.44,0:19:54.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can come back any time you feel like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.68,0:19:58.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, I can't cause you any more trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.57,0:20:00.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, that's not what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.60,0:20:04.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin is always going on about how much she wants to see Reina-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.11,0:20:10.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you... Dai-chan...{Haruko is LOVELY ;__;}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.88,0:20:11.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mama! Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.94,0:20:14.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then can we come this Sunday?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.80,0:20:16.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,H-Hey, Reina!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.05,0:20:20.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Haruko as a child, always in tears...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.94,0:20:25.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And Haruko last night, whispering that she wanted to be a girl forever...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.25,0:20:28.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.11,0:20:31.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Next time you come, pack a little lighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.40,0:20:32.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My arms hurt just looking at that bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.88,0:20:35.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.21,0:20:38.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Girls have an awful lot of things to carry, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.88,0:20:41.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.88,0:20:41.09,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,Bye bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.09,0:20:42.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll see you off!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.53,0:22:17.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.94,0:22:18.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.99,0:22:22.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, but maybe this one would suit you better...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.13,0:22:22.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.95,0:22:25.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can I try this one on, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.02,0:22:26.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.06,0:22:27.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm thirsty!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.77,0:22:30.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, she just has to try it on, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.19,0:22:32.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh! Isn't this one lovely?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.93,0:22:36.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um... Kouki and I are going to go for a little walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.42,0:22:37.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.45,0:22:39.23,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.96,0:22:40.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Look! It really suits you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.04,0:22:41.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're so cute, Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.52,0:22:48.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.90,0:22:50.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It tastes like summer!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.56,0:22:53.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sure does!{Ψ's mark}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.91,0:03:39.91,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,
